        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Acorn RPLBP, Bean Mounting Tip Cast Iron Door</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nA cast iron door pull that is usually used on gates, garage doors, or screen doors, Acorn's Big Bean Tip Cast Iron Door Pull is a simple way to give any light weight door a more antique feel. The beautiful rough black iron finish has a lifetime no rust warranty. The weathered appearance of cast iron duplicates that found on the ironwork of many old European castles and cathedrals.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Bean Tip Cast Iron Door or Gate Pull Acorn RPLBP:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Rough Black Iron</b></li>\r\n<li>Height: 9-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 3-13/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Cast Iron</li>\r\n<li><b>Lifetime No-Rust Finish Warranty!</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually. Package includes 1 pull and hardware for a surface mounted application.</i>\r\n</p>",
